  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The tip of your foe’s weapon slashes across the back of your hand. All the important tendons survive but you lose your grip on whatever you held in that hand as you yank it away.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You must pass a <strong>Challenging (+0) Endurance</strong> Test or drop whatever you held in that hand. Even if you succeed you may not use that hand to attack as your next Action.</p>"
